 "name_en": "Asset-Backed Securities Management – Group Ledger IFRS (6B6)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Asset-Backed Securities Management – Group Ledger IFRS (6B6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">By activating parallel valuation for asset-backed securities management group ledger, you can use an additional valuation area besides your operative valuation area to reflect financial positions, investment, and financing results in accordance with International Financial Reporting Standards (9) phase I (Classification and Measurement).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__ul_gs5_xdd_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Post to parallel ledger of IFRS for transactions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform key date valuation for security account class position</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__ul_hs5_xdd_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate all postings for the general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update the general ledger according to IFRS 9 phase I (Classification and Measurement)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process the valuation of position</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the month-end accounting processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase your focus on value-added activities instead of on manual procedures</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>资产担保证券管理 – 集团分类账 IFRS (6B6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过为资产担保证券管理集团分类账激活并行评估，您可以使用除运营评估范围以外的附加评估范围，根据国际财务报告标准 (9) 阶段 I（分类和度量）反映金融头寸、投资和融资结果。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__ul_gs5_xdd_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">针对交易过账到 IFRS 的并行分类账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行证券账户类头寸的关键日期评估</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc7123ca429354a4097a9990b57c0be21__ul_hs5_xdd_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">生成总账的所有过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据 IFRS 9 阶段 I（分类和度量）更新总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理头寸评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化月末会计处理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">增加您对增值活动的关注，而不是手动程序</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
